# Generated by scripts/artwork/. The originals in /artwork are the input and are
# kept outside the repo; client/public/artwork holds the exported result, which
# the build needs and which is committed. Anchored, or this also swallows
# client/public/artwork and scripts/artwork.
/artwork/

# Screenshots and critiques from the designer skill's build/critique loop.
# Regenerated on demand from a running dev server; never an input to anything.
.design/

# Keys for image/video generation used by the designer skill, kept apart from
# the app's own .env so an agent-scoped, spend-limited key stays that way.
.env.agents
